{"id": "219935", "revid": "2217354", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=219935", "title": "Chola Nadu", "text": "Chola Nadu (\u0b9a\u0bcb\u0bb4\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0b9f\u0bc1 \"Ch\u014dzhan\u0101\u1e0du\") consists of the Kaveri Delta, the homeland of the Chola dynasty in Tamil Nadu.\nTalk.\nDue to the predominance of Chola and Pandya dynasties respectively, the Tamil dialects spoken in Chola Nadu and Pandya Nadu are considered to be some of the purest forms of the spoken language."}
{"id": "219937", "revid": "2217354", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=219937", "title": "Pandya Nadu", "text": "Pandya Nadu (\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bbf\u0baf\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0b9f\u0bc1 \"P\u0101\u1e47\u1e0diyan\u0101\u1e0du\") consists of the homeland of the Pandya dyansty as well as the southernmost point of mainland India.\nTalk.\nDue to the predominance of Chola and Pandya dynasties respectively, the Tamil dialects spoken in Chola Nadu and Pandya Nadu are considered to be some of the purest forms of the spoken language."}
